# CODEOWNERS template. Copy to `.github/CODEOWNERS` and replace the placeholder teams.
#
# Do not add people automatically. Ownership is a team decision: agree the owners first, then
# create the teams on GitHub (Settings > Teams) and reference them here with @org/team-slug.
# Branch protection can then require review from code owners on `main`.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
